I'm Audrey Hamilton, and this is speaking of psychology. Bernardo J. Carducci is a professor of psychology at Indiana University Southeast, where he is the director of the Indiana University Southeast Shyness Research Institute. He is one of the leading experts on shyness and has published numerous books and guides helping children, teens, parents, and other adults understand and manage their shyness. Welcome, Dr. Curtis. Please. Call me Bertie, and thank you for having me here today. This is a real honor.
我是奥黛丽·汉密尔顿，这里是“心理学谈话”。伯纳多·J·卡杜奇是印第安纳大学东南分校的心理学教授，他同时也是该校印第安纳大学东南分校害羞研究所的所长。他是害羞研究领域的顶尖专家之一，曾出版过大量书籍和指南，帮助儿童、青少年、父母以及其他成年人理解并克服害羞。欢迎您，柯蒂斯博士。请叫我伯蒂，非常感谢今天邀请我来到这里。这真的是莫大的荣幸。

