First and foremost, it is not a negative personality trait. It's not a character flaw. It's not a disease. It's simply a description of the individual, how they respond, how they behave. And when I think about shyness, the way I think about shinness is that it involves the characteristic feature of shyness involves excessive self-consciousness and excessive negative critical self-evaluation. We say think about being in front of a mirror. When you look in front of a mirror, I don't care who you are. Most people don't say, oh, my God, how beautiful I am.
首先也是最重要的一点，它绝不是一种消极的人格特质。它不是性格缺陷，也不是一种疾病。它仅仅是对个体的一种描述，描述他们如何反应，如何表现。当我思考害羞时，我所认为的害羞的特征在于，它包含过度的自我意识以及过度的消极批判性自我评估。我们可以想象一下站在镜子前的场景。当你照镜子时，我不管你是谁。大多数人不会说：“哦，天哪，我怎么这么好看。”

7
