is to understand those dynamics of their shyness so that they can control their shyness instead of their shyness controlling them. So that's the real problem with shyness is that it controls you instead of you controlling your shyness. What's the difference between shyness and introversion? You know, why do we need to acknowledge those? Sure, there's a really, really big difference.
理解他们害羞的动态机制，这样他们就能掌控自己的害羞，而不是让害羞掌控他们。所以这才是害羞真正的问题所在——是它在控制你，而不是你在控制你的害羞。害羞和内向有什么区别？你知道，为什么我们需要去认识到这些区别？当然，这两者之间有着非常非常大的区别。

