If you think about shyness and introversion, they may look very much the same. So at a party, a social situation, you'll see a shy person and introvert standing against the wall. The big difference is that the introvert prefers to be there. They prefer to be a way slightly withdrawn from social situation, particularly the social stimulation, the loudness. Shy people are standing against that wall because they feel they have to. They don't know what else to do.
如果你思考一下害羞和内向，它们看起来可能会非常相似。所以在派对或社交场合中，你会看到一个害羞的人和一个内向的人背靠着墙站着。最大的区别在于，内向的人更愿意呆在那里。他们更喜欢稍微远离社交场合，尤其是远离社交刺激和喧闹。而害羞的人站在墙边是因为他们觉得不得不这么做。他们不知道还能做些什么。

