they have to be brilliant, that they have to be witty, that they only get one shot at this. And if they don't have that dynamic opening line, it's over for them. Instead of having that kind of thought, make it a point to talk to lots of different kinds of people for very brief periods. of time. You can always come back to somebody, but when you talk to lots of different people for very brief periods of time, you take the pressure off of yourself. Plus, when you talk to lots of different people for very brief periods of time, you start to be perceived as the kind of person who can talk to lots of different kinds of people, and more importantly, lots of people can talk to you. So people start to notice that, and then they come to you, and you're the person.
他们必须表现得才华横溢，必须妙语连珠，而且他们只有一次机会。如果他们没有说出那句充满活力的开场白，一切就都结束了。与其有这种想法，不如把重点放在与各种不同的人进行非常简短的交谈上。你随时可以再次回到某人身边，但通过与许多不同的人进行非常简短的交谈，你减轻了自己的压力。此外，当你与许多不同的人进行非常简短的交谈时，你开始被视为那种能够与形形色色的人交谈的人，更重要的是，许多人也可以与你交谈。于是人们开始注意到这一点，然后他们会主动来找你，而你成了那个

