comfortable with the situation give her a chance to to warm up let her get used to the to the noise and the environment stay around until she can feel comfortable with the different but then walk away don't stand don't stay the whole time but again and let her know that you're going to be back and that she's going to be a fine. Another thing that you can do, too, is engage in what we call the factorial approach. So, again, changing one or two factors at a time.
舒适为止。给她一个热络的机会，让她习惯噪音和环境，留下来直到她对周围感到自在，然后离开。不要一直待到最后，但再次强调，要让她知道你会回来，而且她会没事的。你能做的另一件事是，采用我们所说的“因子分析法”。也就是说，每次只改变一到两个因素。

